      "description": "DSTUR-T80 USB 继电器 8 通道状态快照。\n\n`channels`：通道号（1-8）→ 是否 ON。True = 24V 输出有效。\n\n**注意**：这是 backend 记忆的\"已下发\"state，**不是**硬件反馈测量——\nDSTUR-T80 协议无状态回读命令。连线松动 / 继电器本身失效不会被发现。\n实际语义：「上次成功 write 的值，假设命令真的生效了」。",
      "properties": {
        "channels": {
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "title": "Channels",
          "type": "object"
        },
        "last_update_ms_ago": {
          "default": 0.0,
          "title": "Last Update Ms Ago",
          "type": "number"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "channels"
      ],
      "title": "RelayState",
      "type": "object"
    }
